      "id": "TRM-A-ARGV-001",
      "status": "requires_actual_execution_confirmation",
      "observation": "Captured-output classifier checks only Array.isArray(command.argv). Empty arrays and arrays of numbers/null or an empty executable token therefore appear eligible despite not specifying an executable argv. The8 cases reject a scalar string but do not exercise these malformed arrays.",
      "requiredBoundary": "Exact hash/path/byte matches must not exempt a file without a genuine non-empty all-string argv and nonblank executable token. Empty string later arguments are valid and should remain allowed."
    }
